"type":"payment","what":"特别股息派发","what_en":"Payment date for special dividend","ann":"11690065","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11690065","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-11-19","type":"payment","what":"特别股息派发","what_en":"Payment date for special dividend","ann":"11689239","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11689239","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-11-19","type":"payment","what":"第二次中期股息派发","what_en":"Payment date for 2nd interim dividend","ann":"11689241","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11689241","src":"ai"},{"date":"2027-01-31","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (11 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Nov (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"}],"recent_en":"Foodie Media posted a 68% year-on-year rise in net profit to about RM15 million for FY2026 and declared a second interim dividend of 0.39 sen and a special dividend of 0.61 sen. The company also announced a memorandum of understanding with a third party, while several directors acquired shares in the open market. Prudential PLC and Eastspring Investments ceased to be substantial shareholders after reducing their stakes in October.","notable_en":["Declared a second interim dividend of 0.39 sen and a second special dividend of 0.61 sen per share.","Signed a memorandum of understanding (details not disclosed).","Announced FY2026 full-year results with net profit up 68% year-on-year to about RM15 million."],"risks_en":["Prudential PLC and Eastspring Investments progressively reduced their stakes in October and ceased to be substantial shareholders.","Directors acquired shares in the open market (not a risk, but a shareholding change)."],"earnings_en":"For 4QFY2026 (ended 31 Aug), revenue was RM15.82 million, up 82.5% year-on-year and 13.7% quarter-on-quarter; net profit was RM4.55 million, up 951.5% year-on-year and 9.7% quarter-on-quarter; net margin was 28.8% versus 29.8% in the previous quarter."}